# Test: OSPFv2 Extended Prefix LSA origination (RFC 7684 sec 2, spec-ospf-ext-4).
#
# VALIDATES: enabling extended-prefix originates an Opaque Type 7 area LSA for a connected prefix through the ext-1 carrier, decoded (Route Type intra-area, prefix) under show ospf database opaque-area.
# PREVENTS: Extended Prefix origination that never reaches the LSDB, or a wrong Route Type.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestOSPFExtPrefixOriginateFunctional -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
